  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6801.01 “Alcohol” means ethanol, ethyl alcohol, or “intoxicating liquors” as defined in RSA 21:33.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 6800) #9685, eff 3-23-10; ss by #12518, eff 4-23-18",
